<h1>Chicago Pneumatic Rotary Screw Air Compressors</h1>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-sm-12 flow">
	    <p>Chicago Pneumatic rotary screw air compressors combine proven design with superior performance. CP offers rotary air compressor ranging in size from 3 - 400 HP as well as both fixed speed and variable speed options. If you are looking for the best rotary screw air compressor, Chicago Pneumatic is the choice. </p>
        <p>For more information or to purchase an item, visit our <a href="~/store/chicago-pneumatic">Chicago Pneumatic Store</a></p>
        <div class="row gap-3">
            <div class="col flow">
                <strong class="mb-4">The Solution for All your Compressed Air Needs</strong>
                <p>When you require a constant demand for air, Chicago Pneumatic screw compressors provide the perfect solution. By using a rotary screw airend, your air compressor can run 24/7 at a 100% duty cycle. Configurations are available in tank-mounted, baseplate, variable speed drive, fixed speed and with integrated air dryers. Multiple sizes are also available in single phase rotary screw models. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col flow">
                <strong class="mb-4">Screw Air Compressors Available in Variable and Fixed Speed</strong>
                <p>Our variable speed drive rotary screw compressor helps to minimize energy consumption by automatically adjusting speed to air demand. Whereas the fixed speed drive screw compressors are useful when you are in need of a constant air flow. Both provide a reliable source of compressed air and available in a range of sizes to suit your needs. Speak to someone today to find the perfect solution.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col flow">
                <strong class="mb-4">High Quality Components in CP air Compressors</strong>
                <p>CP compressors use quality components to ensure long life and reliable operation. Their screw type air compressors are factory tested prior to shipment. A one year warranty comes standard with an additional 4 year parts warranty available upon startup. </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
            <h3>Belt Drive Rotary Screw Air Compressors: 3 to 15 hp </h3>
            <p>The QRS 3-15 is the ultimate commercial air compressor. Thanks to its rotary screw technology, you get more air with lower energy costs. You can use it all day long without cool-down periods, and you can tailor the QRS to your specifications and preferences. This model range is able to handle a wide range of applications. </p>
            <p>QRS stands for "quiet rotary screw" and can be installed right on the shop floor. That is why we made a quiet air compressor with a sound level as low as 61 dB(A). These small rotary screw air compressors are perfect for any facility. </p>
            <p>The Chicago Pneumatic QRS 15 is one of the most popular 15hp compressors on the market. The Chicago Pneumatic QRS 10 provides top CFM output from a 10hp compressor. </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-8">
