                <li>Low Sound and dust protection enclosure</li>
                <li>100% continuous operating capability</li>
                <li>66 gallon or 120 gallon ASME/CRN receiver tank</li>
                <li>Single phase available in 3HP, 5HP and 7.5HP models</li>
                <li>Three phase models available in 3hp, 5hp, 7.5hp, 10hp and 15hp.</li>
                <li>Optional integrated refrigerated air dryer pre-installed</li>
                <li>ES4000 microprocessor controller (QRS10 and QRS15)</li>
                <li>UL, cUL and CSA approved control panel</li>
                <li>Extremely quiet compressors - as low as 61dBA</li>
            </ul>
