            <p>
				The QRS 20-30 range is a rugged industrial screw compressor that combines proven design with superior performance. Every QRS 20-30 can be supplied base mounted or mounted on a 132 gallon receiver tank. An optional integrated air dryer is available as well to save vital floor space. This makes installation into every application is quick and easy.
			</p>
			<p>
				The ES4000 controller manages the QRS20-30 rotary compressors. This is an electronic controller programmed to save on energy costs. Its intelligent shutdown feature makes the QRS one of the more efficient compressors on the market.
			</p>
